# TAPD: My Work

Default lookup for "what's mine to work on right now". Reads
`~/.tapd/cache.json` for `$ME` identity and the workspace list.

## Default behaviour

**当用户发起任何涉及 story / bug 的列表查询，且未明确指定某人时，一律默认
`current_owner = $ME`。** 不要因为用户没说"我的"就去掉这个过滤器——
"查 bug"、"看下需求"、"有哪些 bug" 全都等同于 "看我的 bug / 我的需求"。

When the user asks about stories / bugs without naming a person (including
generic queries like "查 bug", "看需求", "有哪些 bug"):

1. Resolve `$ME` from `cache.json:identity.tapdUserName` —
   currently **{{identity.tapdUserName}}**.
2. Resolve workspace per `tapd-overview` rules (single → use; multi → ask
   or use `lastSelectedWorkspace`).
3. Query stories + bugs (NOT tasks by default) with:
   - `current_owner` filter: `$ME`
   - `status` filter: exclude completed states (see below)
4. Sort the result: in-progress states first, others after.

## Status filter — exclude completed by default

Completed states (excluded by default):

- `resolved` / `已解决`
- `closed` / `已关闭`
- `completed` / `已完成`
- `cancelled` / `已取消`
- `rejected` / `已拒绝`

Project-specific labels can vary. If a workspace uses Chinese labels,
exclude the Chinese variants too. When in doubt, call `tapd_workflows_list`
first to enumerate the workspace's actual statuses.

If the user asks for "包括已完成的" / "全部" / "all including done", drop
the status filter.

## Sort: in-progress first

Within the result, put items whose status matches one of these on top:

- `in_progress` / `处理中`
- `developing` / `开发中`
- `progressing`

Then everything else (planning / new / paused / etc.) below.

When showing the result, use a markdown table:

| ID | Type | Title | Status | Iteration | Updated |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| #1234 | story | 实现登录页 | developing | 2026Q2-S1 | 2026-05-29 |

## Override paths

| User says | Filter applied |
|---|---|
| "查 bug" / "查需求" / "看下需求" (无人名) | `current_owner = $ME`（**默认**，即使没说"我的"） |
| "查我的需求" | `current_owner = $ME`, type = stories |
| "查张三的需求" | `current_owner = 张三`, type = stories |
| "本期所有人的 bug" | NO `current_owner` filter, scoped to current iteration |
| "全部 bug" / "不过滤人" | NO `current_owner` filter |
| "包括我已完成的" | `current_owner = $ME`, NO status filter |
| "@me 任务" | also include tasks (`tapd_tasks_list`) |

> **关键规则**：只要用户没有明确说某人的或"全部/所有人"，一律默认
> `current_owner = $ME`。不要因为用户没说"我的"就去掉这个过滤器。

## What this skill does NOT do

- It does not modify anything (read-only).
- It does not auto-include tasks by default — many teams don't use them
  consistently. Ask if the user wants tasks included.
- It does not log timesheets — see `tapd-log-time`.
- For implementing a specific item, hand off to `tapd-implement-story`.
- For bug analysis, hand off to `tapd-handle-bug`.

## Tools used

- `tapd_stories_list` — filter `current_owner`, optional `status`,
  optional `iteration_id`
- `tapd_bugs_list` — filter `current_owner`, optional `status`
- `tapd_tasks_list` (only when user explicitly asks for tasks)
- `tapd_workflows_list` — optional pre-flight to enumerate status enums

Pagination: keep `limit=50` initially; if more, ask "还想看更多吗？"
before paging through.
